    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);">Editorial Policy</h1>
    <div class="page-body" style="line-height:1.75; font-size:1.02rem;">

<p>Travel Antalya is an independent guide. This page describes how we work.</p>
<h2>Research and accuracy</h2>
<p>We base place and event pages on official sources where they exist: organiser websites, municipal announcements, venue pages and reputable news reports. When a date or detail cannot be confirmed we say so and link to the source so you can check it yourself.</p>
<h2>No paid rankings</h2>
<p>A business cannot pay to be described more favourably. Where a listing carries a "Sponsored" label, it is clearly marked and the text is still written to be useful to the reader, including limitations.</p>
<h2>Advertising and affiliate links</h2>
<p>Ads and affiliate links fund the site. They are kept separate from editorial decisions. See the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
<h2>Corrections</h2>
<p>If you find a mistake, tell us on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. We correct factual errors promptly.</p>

